      "raw": "[quote=\"Rabit\"]\n\nMaybe I should try Cosmic Encounter, again. The first time I played (years ago) I was so turned off by the fact I couldn&#39;t even pick who I was attacking, I had a horrible experience. I&#39;ve since learned it&#39;s a social game, not a tactical one, so maybe I can accept it on those terms...\n\n[/quote]\n\nYeah, it&#39;s a social game to the nth degree. It&#39;s also incredibly cutthroat in its social-ness, to the point that there are people I just cannot play it with. Not for the thin-skinned. Not so much as Diplomacy, though&hellip;\n",
